      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "RULE FOR TASK 3 (TryUpdateEntry copy-on-write conversion): cache the NORMALIZED form at the exact point of insertion into the copy-on-write list \u2014 never assume upstream already normalized it, even when a comment says so. The brief\u0027s Task 2 assertion \u0027the caller already holds it in normalized form\u0027 was unverified and turned out to matter. TryUpdateEntry currently caches LoadEntriesFromSidecars output (already normalized via the load seam); converting it to copy-on-write will instead be caching Me",
